ulated by amino acid availability (PubMed:20381137, PubMed:22980980, PubMed:32868926). The Ragulator complex interacts with SLC38A9; the probable amino acid sensor (PubMed:25561175, PubMed:25567906). Interacts with MAPK1 and MAP2K1 (By similarity). Component of the lysosomal folliculin complex (LFC), composed of FLCN, FNIP1 (or FNIP2), RagA/RRAGA or RagB/RRAGB GDP-bound, RagC/RRAGC or RagD/RRAGD GTP-bound, and Ragulator (PubMed:31672913, PubMed:31704029, PubMed:32868926)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q9Y2Q5-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":150,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000368302.3"],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,108]],"edits":[{"start":109,"end":125,"original":"QALVQYLEEPLTQVAAS","replacement":"VCGTDLCSPSAGPGFGAVPGGAPHPSGGILTALVEAGVRK","added":42}],"missing":0,"replaced":17,"novel":42,"foldedAbsent":14,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[],"interfaces":{"BTF3":[0,1,23]},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q9Y2Q5-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q9Y2Q5-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":74.2,"plddt":[[0,1],[50,3],[70,14],[90,13],[70,5],[50,2],[70,4],[90,14],[70,7],[50,4],[70,3],[90,7],[70,1],[90,6],[70,4],[90,14],[70,2],[90,1],[70,4],[50,2],[0,24],[50,9],[0,1],[50,1],[0,4]],"losingConfidence":0}},{"accession":"Q9Y2Q5-3","name":"3","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":95,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000368304.9"],"refseq":["NM_001145264.2"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001138736.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,77],[78,108,18]],"edits":[{"start":78,"end":107,"original":"EGRVAITRVANLLLCMYAKETVGFGMLKAK","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":30,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":30,"foldedMissing":30,"features":[],"interfaces":{"BTF3":[5,0,23],"DYNLRB1":[3,0,21],"LAMTOR2":[7,0,29],"LAMTOR3":[8,0,36],"LAMTOR4":[7,0,32],"LAMTOR5":[3,0,20]},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q9Y2Q5-3-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q9Y2Q5-3-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":86.6,